{"id":"vod_lz_41926","vodId":"41926","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠TV版","name_cn":"龙珠TV版","date":"1986-01-01","year":"1986","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20221207-1/6b43efe957cee67197657745329cac84.jpg"},"summary":"很久很久以前，曾流传着这样一个传说：世界各地散落着七颗龙珠，只要集齐这些珠子，就可召唤出神龙，而神龙可以帮助你实现任何一个愿望。　　住在深山中的小悟空本领高强，偶然的机会他随时尚少女布尔玛走出大山，四处寻找传说中的龙珠。期间碰上好色的鬼仙人与乌龙、一碰女人就面红耳赤的乐平、自大的小和尚克林，经历了各种各样的艰险和奇遇，也惹出一连串爆笑的故事。当然还有许多邪恶的家伙为了满足私欲寻找龙珠，与小悟空他们展开了连番激斗……　　根据鸟山明同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-12-02 21:21:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":153,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33868_6d223fbe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33870_ea3f6a14/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33871_d2b22b8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33872_c1d21d3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33873_367bb5d2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33874_b27bad31/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33875_d6c30537/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33876_c7885507/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33877_cf9e30de/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33878_8a23a5f6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33880_f3055a27/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33879_6ba9d839/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33881_0e2a32c3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33883_3251cacc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33882_3ccb6b09/in